 ```
 
+### SIM117
+
+```python
+# Bad
+with A() as a:
+    with B() as b:
+        print("hello")
+
+# Good
+with A() as a, B() as b:
+    print("hello")
+```
+
+Thank you for pointing this one out, [Aaron Gokaslan](https://github.com/Skylion007)!
+
+
 ### SIM201
 
 ```python
